  "script": [
    {
      "id": "s1.1",
      "beatId": "b1",
      "text": "Can you guess what the two roots of this equation add up to?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1.2",
      "beatId": "b1",
      "text": "Let us see why.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "transition"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2.1",
      "beatId": "b2",
      "text": "What does it mean to factorise a quadratic?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2.2",
      "beatId": "b2",
      "text": "Factorising {expr:quad.fac.start} gives {expr:quad.fac.done}.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.fac.start",
        "quad.fac.done"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "quad.factorise.claim.b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2.3",
      "beatId": "b2",
      "text": "The two brackets multiplied together make the same quadratic again.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "quad.factorise.claim.b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.1",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "Why does the sum of the roots depend only on the first two coefficients?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.2",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "A root is a value of the unknown that makes the equation true.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.root"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.3",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "Here is our equation {expr:quad.eq}, drawn as a curve.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.eq"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.roots"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.4",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "The curve crosses the axis at the first root, which is two.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.roots"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.5",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "It crosses again at the second root, which is three.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.roots"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.6",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "Now notice something. For any quadratic {expr:quad.general}, the sum of the roots is {expr:quad.rule}.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.general",
        "quad.rule"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.vieta"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.7",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "So the roots themselves decide the sum.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "link",
      "linkClaimIds": [
        "claim.root",
        "claim.vieta"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.8",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "Only the first two coefficients matter, and the last one does not.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.vieta"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3.9",
      "beatId": "b3",
      "text": "Remember the rule: the sum is {expr:quad.rule}, whatever the constant term is.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.rule"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.vieta"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.1",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "Does the shortcut agree with solving the long way?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.2",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "First factorise the equation to get {expr:quad.factored}.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.factored"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.equivalent.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.3",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "Start at zero. The first root is two, so hop to two.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.roots"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.4",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "The second root is three, so hop three more and land on five.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.roots"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.5",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "The two roots add up to {expr:quad.total}.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.total"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.sum.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.6",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "So adding the roots gives the sum.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "link",
      "linkClaimIds": [
        "c.quad.sum.steps.roots",
        "c.quad.sum.steps.sum.1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.7",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "Look at the minus five x term. The sum is five, the same number with its sign flipped.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.sum.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4.8",
      "beatId": "b4",
      "text": "This matches what the rule told us in the last beat, so the shortcut works.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "c.quad.sum.steps.sum.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5.1",
      "beatId": "b5",
      "text": "What goes wrong when we add the numbers in the equation?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5.2",
      "beatId": "b5",
      "text": "Adding the numbers written in the equation does not give the sum of the roots.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "claim.mistake"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5.3",
      "beatId": "b5",
      "text": "Now try one yourself.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "transition"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6.1",
      "beatId": "b6",
      "text": "Can you find the sum of the roots yourself?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "goal"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6.2",
      "beatId": "b6",
      "text": "What do the roots of {expr:quad.q.eq} add up to?",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.q.eq"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "question",
      "questionId": "quad.sum.q.recall"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6.3",
      "beatId": "b6",
      "text": "The roots add up to {expr:quad.q.answer}.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [
        "quad.q.answer"
      ],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "quad.sum.q.recall.answer.b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6.4",
      "beatId": "b6",
      "text": "Check it with the rule: the sum is minus the second coefficient over the first.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "quad.sum.q.recall.answer.b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6.5",
      "beatId": "b6",
      "text": "Each root is a value that makes the equation true, so you can test your answer.",
      "termSpans": [],
      "exprRefs": [],
      "status": "draft",
      "role": "claim",
      "claimId": "quad.sum.q.recall.answer.b6"
    }
  ],
